Star Wars the Force Unleashed Ultimate Sith Edtion is a good game? Yes ;
Star Wars the Force Unleashed Ultimate Sith Edtion is a fun? Yes;
Star Wars the Force Unleashed Ultimate Sith Edtion is well optimized? Nope;
So SWTFUUSE is a very good game, that fits well in the SW lore, many people say that Starkiller is to strong, compared with other Jedi, but many times in the SW lore we see force users that are even more powerfull than him, the game is a good Hack'n'Slash, the controls could be better since it has only one button for atacking, but the combos are easy to do and rewarding at the same time, the history is not the same from the Ps2/Wii version, because of the Ps3/Xbox 360 could not run the whole game with the upgraded graphics and engine, so it has less missions and is missing the Duel system of the Wii version. but now the Main problem FPS, the game seem to tank so heavy in certain resolutions especialy the native of your monitor, so drop down the resolution and the game will run in 30 fps without drops. ( This is a old game and a console port, do not complain about a FPS lock).
To ME this is the Best SW Sith Experience and its a 9/10.
